—❗️🇺🇸/🇮🇷/🇸🇾 BREAKING: The IRGC announces the latest missile barrage of Operation Nasr-2 targeted the U.S. Special Forces command center at Al-Tanf, southern Syria, in a surprise attack

The surprised attack resulted in a radar system and helicopters being destroyed, as well as a large number of American soldiers being killed, according to the statement.

